     3	/**
     4	 * ADR-0002 / US-01-T-32.
     5	 *
     6	 * - Creates a development super admin from STRAPI_ADMIN_EMAIL / STRAPI_ADMIN_PASSWORD when no admin
     7	 *   user exists (the same account the AC-03 end-to-end test and the human use).
     8	 * - Deletes Strapi's default "Full Access" API token: an unused write credential. No token is ever
     9	 *   copied into a `.env`.
