test(frontend): remove scaffold app.spec.ts with no spec basis

The Angular CLI scaffold asserted an <h1> 'Hello, frontend' on the root App. Per ADR-0001 App only hosts <router-outlet />, and headings belong to the pages. Routing and app shell remain covered by quote-form-page.spec.ts through the real routes and appConfig.

Refs: US-01

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


