Author: Felipe Sabogal <100255652+FelipeSuarez25@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Sat Nov 21 00:03:39 2026 -0500

    test(frontend): tolerate focus staying on the field being left in the keyboard-only e2e

    The native date control has several tab stops, so tabTo failed when focus
    stayed on the field being left. Focus on any other field still fails.
    Closed selects are driven by type-ahead, since ArrowDown opens the popup
    in Chromium on macOS.

    Refs: US-01-AC-24
    Resolves: gate attempt 1

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

